WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Okay, come on, pay attention to safety

2
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,270
The base is over here

3
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:09,070
But it's still marked on the map

4
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,750
There is a large zoo nearby

5
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:25,900
Most of the animals inside have also mutated, so be extra careful, Xiaoqing Jiansu

6
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:33,860
There's something wrong with the bridge ahead. The passage is very narrow.

7
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,660
Can accommodate up to one and a half car bodies

8
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,820
This is deliberately forcing us to slow down.

9
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:44,920
There is a small gathering place around the bridge

10
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,800
There are still simple houses on Jiangxin Island

11
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:48,860
There must be someone guarding this
